## 💻 About the Project
This project was developed as a practical step in my web development journey. The primary goal was to build a clean, modern, and fully responsive landing page, strictly adhering to the proposed design while implementing semantical layout structures and modern styling principles.

The layout was fully optimized to ensure an excellent reading and browsing experience, adapting fluidly from smartphones up to large desktop screens.

